{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","乱魂送葬"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","乱魂の葬送"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤幽魂肆虐全场。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","フィールド上で暴れ回る幽魂を召喚"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤10道幽魂，幽魂会对随机敌人造成110% + 15% ATK伤害，持续10秒。幽魂造成伤害时，雪米拉会获得等同于伤害量50% + 5%的治疗，幽魂返回时，雪米拉会获得等同于伤害量50% + 5%的治疗，施放终极技能后，每名敌人累计受到15次及以上的伤害时，幽魂造成的伤害降低至50%。被动地，大招持续期间，通过“换命夺魂”凝聚的幽魂也会参与攻击。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","10体の幽魂を10秒間召喚。幽魂は「ランダムな敵に110% + 15% ATKのダメージを与え、シェミーラの元に戻る」を繰り返す。幽魂がダメージを与えた時、シェミーラのHPが与えたダメージの50% + 5%分回復。幽魂がシェミーラの元に戻った時、シェミーラのHPがそのダメージの50% + 5%分回復。敵が幽霊から15回以上ダメージを受けると、その敵への幽魂の与ダメージが50%にDOWN。幽霊からの被ダメージ回数のカウントはシェミーラが必殺技を発動するたびにリセットされる。パッシブ効果：必殺技の持続期間中、「魂の生成」で生成した幽魂も攻撃に参加する"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":64,"end":69,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":94,"end":99,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":98,"end":103,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":142,"end":147,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","幽魂造成的伤害提升至120% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","幽魂のダメージが120% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat